  topic: Policy Committee Report (Rosemarie DeAngelis)
  desc: Chair DeAngelis presented the Policy Committee report, including two first
    reads for policies BEDH and BCA-E, and discussed the status of the cell phone
    policy review.
  children:
  - seconds: 5913
    speaker: Rosemarie DeAngelis
    text: 'The Policy Committee has two first reads: Policy BEDH, concerning public
